#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.nix.md:1
msgid "`manifest.nix`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.nix.md:3
msgid ""
"The manifest file records the provenance of the packages that are installed "
"in a [profile](./profiles.md) managed by [`nix-env`](../../command-ref/nix-"
"env.md)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.nix.md:5
msgid ""
"Here is an example of how this file might look like after installing `hello` "
"from Nixpkgs:"
msgstr ""

