#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.nix.md:126
msgid ""
"Each element in this list corresponds to an installed package. It "
"incorporates some attributes of the original derivation, including `meta`, "
"`name`, `out`, `outPath`, `outputs`, `system`. This information is used by "
"Nix for querying and updating the package."
msgstr ""
